# Meeting-pipeline crontab TEMPLATE for a per-jurisdiction Lightsail box.
# Rendered by provision-jurisdiction.sh (__SLUG__ -> the jurisdiction slug)
# and installed with `crontab <rendered file>` as the `ubuntu` user. The
# LFUCG reference box keeps its hand-written deploy/lightsail/crontab.txt.
#
# Box TZ:   sudo timedatectl set-timezone America/New_York
#           (cron honors the system TZ; ET keeps the schedule aligned to
#            when the portal posts clips, and DST is handled automatically)
#
# All jobs share one flock so a long catch-up run can never overlap the next
# tick or the weekly backfill (-n = skip this firing if the lock is held).
# The lock + log paths are per-slug so two boxes never collide if co-located.
#
# Each job appends `&& heartbeat.sh __SLUG__-<name>` — a success-only dead-man
# ping to CloudWatch (LT/Heartbeat). `&&` means a failed run (or a lock-
# contended skip) sends NO ping. The weekly index backup self-heartbeats from
# inside the script after the S3 upload, so its cron line has no appended ping.
#
# IMPORTANT (cold-start gate, spec §2.6): do NOT install this crontab until
# the one-time cold-start backfill has finished. Lean + bulk runs fighting
# over search.db / ChromaDB during the initial archive sweep is the failure
# mode the flock can't prevent (different scripts, same data dir).
#
# Provisioning note: document-driven jurisdictions (CivicClerk, e.g. Paris)
# install ingest + daily summaries + weekly index backup and OMIT the weekly
# backfill line (backfill-docs / tables-of-motions are Granicus-packet
# specific). Granicus jurisdictions install all four.
#
# Lean incremental ingest — every 6h on weekdays at 02:00/08:00/14:00/20:00 ET.
# probe -> process new clips -> RAG ingest -> reload API -> S3 + CF + feeds
0 2,8,14,20 * * 1-5  /usr/bin/flock -n /tmp/__SLUG__-pipeline.lock /opt/fuzzy-potato/deploy/lightsail/ingest_cron.sh    >> /var/log/__SLUG__-ingest.log 2>&1 && /opt/fuzzy-potato/deploy/lightsail/heartbeat.sh __SLUG__-ingest

# Daily v2-summary upgrade — every day at 00:00 ET. Generates the two-pass
# summary + facts for clips the lean ingest deferred, re-ingests + refreshes.
0 0 * * *            /usr/bin/flock -n /tmp/__SLUG__-pipeline.lock /opt/fuzzy-potato/deploy/lightsail/summaries_cron.sh  >> /var/log/__SLUG__-summaries.log 2>&1 && /opt/fuzzy-potato/deploy/lightsail/heartbeat.sh __SLUG__-summaries

# Heavy archive-wide sweeps — weekly, Sunday 03:00 ET. (Granicus only — omit
# on document-driven boxes.) backfill-docs + tables-of-motions, then reload.
0 3 * * 0            /usr/bin/flock -n /tmp/__SLUG__-pipeline.lock /opt/fuzzy-potato/deploy/lightsail/backfill_weekly.sh >> /var/log/__SLUG__-backfill.log 2>&1 && /opt/fuzzy-potato/deploy/lightsail/heartbeat.sh __SLUG__-backfill

# Weekly off-box index backup — Sunday 04:30 ET. tars chroma_db + search.db +
# rag_state.json (+ state.json) to S3. Self-heartbeats __SLUG__-index-backup.
30 4 * * 0           /usr/bin/flock -n /tmp/__SLUG__-pipeline.lock /opt/fuzzy-potato/deploy/lightsail/backup_indexes.sh  >> /var/log/__SLUG__-backup.log 2>&1
